# Tomik's "plus 1" and Mjölnir's "double" both replace the same damage (CR 616.1): Gau, Feral Youth (legendary red-green, so worthy of
# Mjölnir, which is equipped to him) deals damage equal to his power (2: he has not attacked, so no Rage) to each opponent when Faithless
# Looting flashes back (a card leaves the graveyard), and the player being dealt the damage, Bot2, chooses which applies first. Bot2
# chooses Mjölnir: 2 doubled is 4, plus 1 is 5 (20 -> 15). Counterpart: tomik-then-mjolnir-the-damaged-opponent-chooses-to-add-first-for-six.

